DESCRIPTION:Robert Lighthouse\, a native of Sweden\, first came to the Uni
 ted States at the age of 18\, determines to learn more about the music he 
 loves -Mississippi Delta Blues For eight years he traveled around the coun
 try absorbing American roots music from Chicago’s famed Maxwell Street t
 o New Orleans\, the cradle of the blues. He settled in Washington\, D.C. i
 n 1988 and quickly established a vibrant fan base. He has extensively tour
 ed Russia and Ukraine and was signed to Qualified Records as an artist in 
 2022
LOCATION:Madam's Organ Blues Bar\, 2461 18th Street NW\, Washington\, DC 2
 0009
